(7408063, 1167368, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent low contrast. And this visualizes exactly what it''s felt like in the past week here in NY. Gloom and doom but with the future to look forward to.</td>', 'Excellent low contrast. And this visualizes exactly what it''s felt like in the past week here in NY. Gloom and doom but with the future to look forward to.', '2015-10-05 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7408064, 1166928, 38032, '<td valign="top">Firstly, a really interesting breakwall type thing - I''ve never seen something quite like that. Secondly, you have captured the quiet morning mood - I can hear the gentle white noise of the waves and almost hear the swimmer''s routine. Thirdly, this is one of the few that seems to meet the challenge naturally.<br/>Well done. 8<br/> <br/>Take a blue with you <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1167384" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/38032/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1167384.png"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-10-09 08:53:27.</i></td>', 'Firstly, a really interesting breakwall type thing - I''ve never seen something quite like that. Secondly, you have captured the quiet morning mood - I can hear the gentle white noise of the waves and almost hear the swimmer''s routine. Thirdly, this is one of the few that seems to meet the challenge naturally.Well done. 8 Take a blue with you ', '2015-10-05 13:52:05.000000', '2015-10-09 09:53:27.000000', 1),
