(7409329, 1167263, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Looks like a 9am Newark departure. We''ve flown from there numerous occasions and never seen this view. Better timing next time - maybe even better heading to Australia?</td>', 'Beautiful. Looks like a 9am Newark departure. We''ve flown from there numerous occasions and never seen this view. Better timing next time - maybe even better heading to Australia?', '2015-10-09 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
